%% ADR-0048 proposal. No PR yet. linear_*.py modules are proposed.
sequenceDiagram
    participant Session as CoBuilder session
    participant CLI as tracker.py
    participant Linear as LinearAdapter - proposed
    participant API as Linear API

    Session->>CLI: claim-next
    CLI->>Linear: claim_next(claimant, under)

    Note over Linear,API: Full read, about 6 requests for 265 issues. includeArchived is true, because Linear skips archived issues by default
    loop each page of 50 issues
        Linear->>API: issues query with parent, relations, assignee, state, cobuilder:// attachments
        API-->>Linear: page of issues and endCursor
    end
    Linear->>Linear: map rows to TrackerRecord, no envelope means unplanned
    alt Linear type is completed and the envelope score is 0.90 or more
        Linear->>Linear: the slice reads as closed
    else Linear type is completed with no passing score
        Linear->>Linear: the slice reads as open, and the next slice stays blocked
    end
    Linear->>Linear: compute ready on the client
    Note over Linear: Ready means open and unclaimed, each blocker closed, and the parent epic has no open blocker. Never a pull request or an unplanned issue
    Linear->>Linear: pick the first ready slice

    Note over Linear,API: claim_slice
    alt the slice already has a claim
        Linear->>Linear: refuse this slice, as beads does
    else the slice has no claim
        opt a claim exists on a slice that is not in progress and is older than two minutes
            Linear->>API: delete the stale claim attachment
        end
        Linear->>API: attachmentCreate cobuilder://repo/id#claim-nonce
        Linear->>API: query all claim attachments of the issue
        API-->>Linear: claim attachments with server creation time
        alt this nonce is earliest by server time, or wins the tie on the lower nonce
            Linear->>API: issueUpdate sets the assignee from the users map
            Linear->>API: attachment update writes the envelope with state in_progress
            Linear-->>CLI: claimed TrackerRecord
            CLI-->>Session: JSON record
        else another claim is earlier
            Linear->>API: delete own claim attachment
            Linear->>Linear: refuse this slice
        end
    end
    opt the claim was refused
        Linear->>Linear: claim_next takes the next ready slice
        Linear-->>CLI: next slice record, or None when no slice is ready
        CLI-->>Session: JSON record, or empty answer
    end

    Note over Session,API: Later, the slice leaves in_progress
    Session->>CLI: set-slice-state closed
    CLI->>Linear: set_slice_state(id, state)
    Linear->>API: issueUpdate moves the workflow state
    Linear->>API: delete the claim attachment of the slice
    Linear->>API: attachment update stores the new state type in seen

    Note over Session,API: Release of a crashed claim
    Session->>CLI: set-slice-state open
    CLI->>Linear: set_slice_state(id, open)
    Linear->>API: delete all claim attachments of the slice
    Linear->>API: issueUpdate clears the assignee

    Note over Session,API: Second part, sync finds a plan change
    Session->>CLI: sync
    CLI->>Linear: sync()
    Linear->>API: full read as above
    API-->>Linear: issues with envelopes and seen values
    Linear->>Linear: compare each plan field with the value seen last
    Note over Linear: Plan fields are title, description hash, parent id, sorted blocker ids, workflow state type, and assignee id
    alt a plan field differs from its seen value
        Linear->>API: commentCreate, one comment on the changed issue
        Linear->>API: attachment update refreshes the seen values
        Linear->>Linear: set plan_changes with field, old value, and new value
        Linear-->>CLI: sync done
        CLI-->>Session: JSON payload with plan_changes
    else every field equals its seen value
        Linear-->>CLI: sync done
        CLI-->>Session: JSON payload without plan_changes
    end
    Note over Linear: A CoBuilder write updates only the seen fields that it writes, so it raises no plan change
